          <p>
            The Dyson V8, Shark PowerPro, Levoit and Eureka are simpler and cheaper. For a home that is mostly hardwood, they do the job well, and the lighter ones are easier to use every day. For crumbs under the table or dust on the stairs, a separate <a href="/best-handheld-vacuum/">handheld vacuum</a> is often quicker to grab than unclipping a stick vacuum's wand.
          </p>

